<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25331" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαμφισβήτ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>disputing,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἔχει πότερον . .</span> it admits of
				<i>dispute</i> whether . ., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1256a14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαμφισβητήσεις ἔχειν</span>
			contain <i>ambiguous points,</i> of Solon's laws, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				35.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα ὑπὸ τὴν δ. ἠγμένη</span>
			<i>disputed</i> territory, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				685.55
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Crete</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. παρέξειν πότερον . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Tim.Praef.</u>
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				4.1
			</span></i>.</div>
